I think this is a good idea and would go along well with my earlier
YANI of monsters that have a voice attack (e.g. a siren that enchants
you by singing.) Deaf players would be immune to such attacks. You
could also purposefully deafen yourself by wearing earmuffs (a new
item) or plugging your ears with wax.
A couple other sound attack monsters I thought of:
- Mandrake root: originally, the mandrake root was supposed to kill
with a scream. I dislike insta-deaths generally and don't want to add
another one, but perhaps it could take off a large number of hit
points (or maybe only kill if you're within one square of it.)
- Sonic boom: a monster of the "y" type (like yellow light), with a
kamikaze attack: it approaches you and explodes when it reaches you,
deafening you for a set number of turns and also taking off some hit
points.

Any other ideas?

